# JS Module Patterns

## DOM Manipulation

```javascript
// WRONG: innerHTML with untrusted content
el.innerHTML = llmResponse;

// CORRECT: sanitize first
import { sanitize } from './sanitize.js';
el.innerHTML = sanitize(llmResponse);
```

## Event Handlers

```javascript
// WRONG: inline handler in template literal
`<button onclick="App.Engine.doThing('${name}')">Go</button>`

// CORRECT: data-action delegation
`<button data-action="do-thing" data-name="${sanitize(name)}">Go</button>`
// Then handle in js/events.js
```

## State Mutations

```javascript
// WRONG: silent mutation
State.gold += 50;

// CORRECT: dispatch for observable changes
dispatch({ type: 'ADD_GOLD', amount: 50 });

// Direct mutation is OK for transient state like:
State.isProcessing = true;
State.tempPortraitData = dataUrl;
```

## Error Handling

```javascript
// WRONG
try { await api.call(); } catch (e) {}

// CORRECT
try {
    await api.call();
} catch (e) {
    console.error('API call failed:', e);
    UI.addChatLog('System', 'Anfrage fehlgeschlagen: ' + e.message);
}
```

## Numeric Parsing from LLM Tags

```javascript
// WRONG: unvalidated parseInt
const dmg = parseInt(parts[1]);
char.hp -= dmg; // NaN if malformed

// CORRECT: validate before use
const dmg = parseInt(parts[1], 10);
if (isNaN(dmg) || dmg < 0) return;
```
